  "message.guogaology.no_safe_return": "No safe return location was found. Clear the exit or ask an administrator.",
  "message.guogaology.guide": "§bGuogaology§r\nRing: twelve blocks in a 5x5 outline without corners; keep the central 3x3 empty.\nOverworld: whole cakes (Guogao blocks may be mixed in) + apple -> Outer.\nOuter -> Inner: 12 mineral storage blocks, freely mixing omega, epsilon, Gamma and Omega; throw in one Omega mineral.\nInner -> Underworld: 12 Guogao blocks of any color, plus one thrown Guogao block.\nReturn: 4 cobblestone + 1 plank -> 1 Outer Return Frame; 4 Ordinal Shards + 1 plank -> 1 Inner Return Frame; 4 Guogao Dreadsoil + 1 Dread Fir Plank -> 1 Dread Forest Return Frame. Use any planks where unspecified. Place 12 matching frames and throw in 1 Return Token (1 plank above 1 stick) to return one layer; do not mix frame types.\nHorizontal scale Overworld:Outer:Inner:Underworld = 1:1:4:16.\nFalling out of Inner reaches Underworld Y=500; quarter gravity, no fall damage.\nOperator travel commands and portal kits: /guogaology help.",
